- The existing Sign in with ChatGPT path already uses dynamic registration, a stable `ext_agent_host_id`, browser launch, loopback callback, state/nonce/PKCE, token exchange, ID-token validation, token refresh, account-specific `GET /v1/models`, and streamed `POST /v1/responses`.
