- Removed the obsolete blanket Free-account denial from the inference error.
- Added a visible `gpt-6-luna` catalogue fixture and confirmed account-visible model slugs pass through unchanged while hidden models remain filtered.
- Updated README instructions, including `agy --provider openai --model gpt-6-luna` when that model appears in the account catalogue.
