## OpenAI SIWC eligibility clarification — 2026-11-11

Rechecked the current official wording after the implementation:
- OpenAI Help Center article "Using your ChatGPT plan in other apps and sites", updated Nov 11 2026, states: "Supported open-source tools remain available to all ChatGPT users" (includes Free accounts by implication).
